---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Reviews policy" description="How customer reviews work on Calib.Tools.">
  <section class="container-x py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="prose-calib mx-auto max-w-[640px]">
      <h1 class="h-display m-0 text-[32px] leading-[1.08] md:text-[44px]">Reviews policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">How customer reviews work on Calib.Tools.</p>
      <ol class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        <li>Only customers we e-mail after delivery can submit a review. Each invitation is linked to a specific order and line item.</li>
        <li>Each review is tied to an order number. The link between the review and the purchase is stored but the order number is never displayed publicly.</li>
        <li>All reviews are published, including negative ones. We do not select, reorder, or suppress reviews based on rating.</li>
        <li>We remove only spam, personal attacks, or content that contains personal data (addresses, phone numbers). When we remove a review, a visible note stating the reason replaces it.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-8 text-[15px] text-ink-muted">We do not pay for reviews, offer discounts in exchange for reviews, or use any other incentive.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-ink-muted">
        Questions? <a href="mailto:hello@calib.tools">hello@calib.tools</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
